{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31337","headline":"重阳宴东观山亭和从事卢顺之 · 张固","name":"重阳宴东观山亭和从事卢顺之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱山青翠郡城东，爽节凭高一望通。\n交友会时丝管合，羽觞飞处笑言同。\n金英耀彩晴云外，玉树凝霜暮雨中。\n高咏已劳潘岳思，醉欢慙道自车公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张固","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}